        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You're critically hit by a damage-dealing effect or Strike.</p><hr /><p>You snap a layer of brittle scrap into place between you and the triggering blow, the scrap shatters and absorbs some of the force of the impact. The scrap has Hardness 5 and @Damage[10[healing]] Hit Points. If the scrap is destroyed, you take any excess damage that the scrap didn't absorb. After taking the blow, the scrap collapses into a pile of junk.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The scrap's Hit Points increase by 10.</p>"
